2026-07-27T08:44:20.8699892Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-27T08:44:20.8767302Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T08:44:20.8767958Z i /tmp/RtmpjLGlo0/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:44:20.8768293Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:44:20.8768689Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:44:20.8769322Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:44:20.8769882Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:44:20.8771042Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:44:20.8771655Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T08:44:20.9042769Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:44:20.9159385Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:44:20.9628042Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:44:20.9805207Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
